1
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:53,030
[The Old Story of Yu Hong]

2
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:55,780
[Episode 34]

3
00:01:00,030 --> 00:01:00,760
You're back.

4
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:04,989
What's wrong?

5
00:01:05,790 --> 00:01:06,470
Let's eat.

6
00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:16,760
Where's Qianqian?

7
00:01:18,539 --> 00:01:19,800
Wan Xiuhua adores her.

8
00:01:20,490 --> 00:01:22,420
She took her to the shop for hot pot.

9
00:01:26,950 --> 00:01:27,920
Don't let her always

10
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:29,680
hang around Wan Xiuhua's shop.

11
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,740
She won't learn anything good there.

12
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:20,560
Yang.

13
00:02:23,470 --> 00:02:24,690
Since you came back from the forest farm,

14
00:02:24,690 --> 00:02:26,620
you and I haven't had a proper chat

15
00:02:28,020 --> 00:02:29,130
or a proper

16
00:02:29,470 --> 00:02:30,960
meal together.

17
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:33,530
Our parents passed away early.

18
00:02:34,060 --> 00:02:35,840
I raised you all by myself.

19
00:02:37,930 --> 00:02:39,990
Look at you now. In the blink of an eye—

20
00:02:40,620 --> 00:02:42,280
