21
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:46,560
Although

22
00:02:47,870 --> 00:02:49,400
I didn't really approve you

23
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,780
and Chen Hong at first,

24
00:02:54,050 --> 00:02:55,020
anyway,

25
00:02:55,020 --> 00:02:57,350
you've settled down and started a family.

26
00:02:58,700 --> 00:02:59,990
As your sister...

27
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:06,630
Juan.

28
00:03:11,430 --> 00:03:12,360
You know,

29
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:15,130
I've never been the kind of kid

30
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:18,340
who's good with words, right?

31
00:03:20,750 --> 00:03:21,370
I...

32
00:03:24,210 --> 00:03:25,130
Anyway,

33
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:26,880
these past few years,

34
00:03:27,300 --> 00:03:28,500
it's been hard on you.

35
00:03:30,590 --> 00:03:34,050
Just because I got married
doesn't mean I won't come visit you.

36
00:03:35,170 --> 00:03:35,800
Juan.

37
00:03:37,370 --> 00:03:39,300
If you have feelings for He Liang,

38
00:03:41,050 --> 00:03:41,850
