39
00:03:43,690 --> 00:03:45,410
I fully support the two of you.

40
00:03:46,340 --> 00:03:47,750
If not, that's fine too.

41
00:03:49,650 --> 00:03:51,710
I'll take care of you when you're old.

42
00:03:52,130 --> 00:03:52,620
Okay?

43
00:03:53,750 --> 00:03:55,280
Look at you, crying now.

44
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:00,800
Look at your face. Stop crying.

45
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:01,960
Come on.

46
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:05,940
I've got my life together now.

47
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:07,870
Our good days are ahead.

48
00:04:14,910 --> 00:04:15,870
I just remembered

49
00:04:15,870 --> 00:04:17,730
things from when you were little.

50
00:04:18,550 --> 00:04:20,329
You were so naughty when you were little.

51
00:04:20,329 --> 00:04:22,060
Like a monkey, so mischievous.

52
00:04:23,100 --> 00:04:25,150
Mom used to hit you with a broom.

53
00:04:26,770 --> 00:04:27,630
It broke my heart,

54
00:04:27,630 --> 00:04:29,840
so I secretly swapped the wooden stick

55
00:04:30,010 --> 00:04:31,660
for a sorghum stalk.

56
00:04:32,420 --> 00:04:33,330
Do you still remember?

57
00:04:33,330 --> 00:04:34,100
I remember.

58
00:04:34,630 --> 00:04:36,360
I was so naughty back then.

59
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:40,020
You also used to steal Dad's woolen coat.

60
00:04:40,130 --> 00:04:42,070
Yeah, I loved that coat.

61
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:44,290
I was still short back then.

62
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:45,330
When I wore it, it dragged on the floor.

63
00:04:45,330 --> 00:04:46,950
I kept stepping on

64
00:04:46,950 --> 00:04:48,360
the bottom of the coat.

65
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:50,290
When it got dirty, Mom would hit me.

66
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:52,409
Every time I wore it, she'd beat me.

67
00:04:53,190 --> 00:04:54,750
There was one time
when Three Eyes wanted to borrow it.

68
00:04:54,750 --> 00:04:56,750
I refused to lend it to him in the end.

69
00:05:02,130 --> 00:05:02,720
Oh right.

70
00:05:04,690 --> 00:05:05,420
Take a look.

71
00:05:06,100 --> 00:05:06,830
What's this?

72
00:05:12,570 --> 00:05:13,200
Isn't this...

73
00:05:13,200 --> 00:05:15,200
Isn't this the button from the coat?

74
00:05:16,250 --> 00:05:17,250
How'd it fall off?

75
00:05:17,690 --> 00:05:19,190
Didn't I tell you when you

76
00:05:19,190 --> 00:05:20,060
wore it earlier?

77
00:05:20,060 --> 00:05:21,100
I said that coat

78
00:05:21,100 --> 00:05:22,530
