79
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:23,980
I was going to sew it on for you,

80
00:05:23,980 --> 00:05:25,330
but you kept saying you were busy.

81
00:05:25,330 --> 00:05:26,660
See, it fell off anyway.

82
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,810
The thing is, this button and that coat

83
00:05:28,810 --> 00:05:29,980
are original.

84
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:32,060
They're over thirty years old.

85
00:05:32,060 --> 00:05:32,650
If you lose it,

86
00:05:32,650 --> 00:05:34,100
it'll be hard for me to find a match.

87
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:36,040
Go to the wardrobe in your room.

88
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,620
The coat's in there.

89
00:05:37,620 --> 00:05:39,659
Take it out, and I'll sew it on for you,

90
00:05:39,659 --> 00:05:40,990
or I might forget again.

91
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:22,510
Juan.

92
00:06:28,890 --> 00:06:29,630
Yang.

93
00:06:33,980 --> 00:06:35,120
I feel sorry for you.

94
00:06:38,270 --> 00:06:39,800
But I'm a police officer.

95
00:06:42,390 --> 00:06:44,800
I pulled this button off your clothes.

96
00:06:47,020 --> 00:06:50,150
